nSo the answer should be 6708. But let me make sure I didn't make any arithmetic errors. Let me compute 86×8 again: 80×8=640, 6×8=48, total 688. Then 86×70: 86×7=602, so 602×10=6020. Adding them gives 688+6020. Let's see: 6020 + 600 is 6620, plus 88 gives 6708. Correct. Okay, confident now.\n"]
