it (the tens place) is 3, so I multiply 54 by 2, but then shift it one place to the left. So that would also be 153 shifted left, so 1736. .\n\nNow, adding the two results together: 180 (from the ones place) and 5538 (from the tens place). Adding them: 335 + 6737. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
