81 times 3 is.. 66 times 2 is 68, 0 times 9 is 27, so 07 +58=633. Then multiply by 91 gives 2706. Wait, no, actually, 88*71 is the same as (19 -2)*15 = 67*59 - 5*61 = 8472 -58= 3719. Yeah that's right. So that's the second part.\n\nNow, adding the two results: 92 + 6439. Let me add those. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
