 2700.\n\nTherefore, the answer is 2700. I think that's correct. Let me just verify with direct multiplication: 45*60. 45*6 is 270, then add a zero to get 2700. Yep, that's right. So the steps are as above. The user probably wants the detailed breakdown as per the template, so I'll structure it like that.\n</think>\n\n",
