e position):\n  18\u00d790 = 1620\nAdding them: 126 + 1620 = 1746. Yes, that's correct.\n\nAlternatively, using the distributive property: (20 - 2) \u00d7 97 = 20\u00d797 - 2\u00d797 = 1940 - 194 = 1746. Yep, same result. So I think that's correct. The steps in the reasoning should reflect breaking it down into the two parts and adding them.\n</think>\n\n",
